    "sections": {
        "description": "Nutritionist is a clean, modern, and professional theme designed for nutritionists, dietitians, wellness coaches, health consultants, and healthy lifestyle professionals. Its flexible layout helps you create a trustworthy online presence for showcasing your services, expertise, programs, blog posts, recipes, and client resources. The theme features a responsive design that adapts smoothly to desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. With a clean visual structure and easy-to-navigate layouts, you can present your nutrition services and professional information in a clear and engaging way. Nutritionist works with the drag &amp; drop builder, allowing you to personalize key aspects of your website such as colors, typography, logo, menus, homepage sections, and other theme settings without editing code. Whether you are building a website for a private nutrition practice, diet consultation service, wellness coaching business, or nutrition-focused blog, Nutritionist provides a flexible foundation for creating a professional WordPress website."
    },
